# No environment variables are required to build or run this site.
#
# The contact form (src/components/ContactForm.astro) posts directly to
# public/contact.php, a plain PHP mail handler that runs on HostGator's
# own PHP/Apache at runtime — no SMTP credentials or application secrets
# needed, since contact.php uses PHP's local mail() transport.
#
# The only secrets this project has are the four FTP deploy credentials
# used by .github/workflows/deploy.yml, and those live in the GitHub repo's
# Actions secrets (Settings -> Secrets and variables -> Actions), never in
# a file: FTP_SERVER, FTP_USERNAME, FTP_PASSWORD, FTP_SERVER_DIR.
